{
  "key": 63847,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahahaha!\r",
        "A mere child like you dares to\n",
        "challenge me?\r",
        "The very idea makes me shiver\n",
        "with mirth!\r",
        "Very well, I shall show you true\n",
        "terror as a ninja master.\r",
        "Poison brings steady doom.\n",
        "Sleep renders foes helpless.\r",
        "Despair to the creeping horror of\n",
        "Poison-type Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "Fuchsia Gym is a tricked-up place.\n",
        "It’s riddled with invisible walls!\r",
        "Koga might appear close, but he’s\n",
        "blocked off.\r",
        "You have to find gaps in the walls\n",
        "to reach him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymAides_Text_FuchsiaCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Koga’s Gym is full of walls you\f",
        "can’t see!\r",
        "Challengers bump around looking for\n",
        "the way through, and it wears them\f",
        "out before they reach the Leader.\r",
        "Sneaky… but very ninja!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Fuchsia Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Koga\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "When afflicted by Toxic, a Pokémon\n",
        "suffers more and more.\r",
        "It suffers worsening damage as the\n",
        "battle wears on!\r",
        "It will surely terrorize foes!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s amazing how ninja can terrify,\n",
        "even now!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymAides_Text_FuchsiaCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Soul Badge, your Gym PC\n",
        "sells Invisible Walls.\r",
        "You’ll see them while decorating,\n",
        "but challengers won’t. Build a maze…\f",
        "just leave them a way through!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Fuchsia Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Koga\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaExplainSoulBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Now that you have the Soulbadge,\n",
        "the Defense of your Pokémon rises.\r",
        "It also lets you Surf outside of\n",
        "battle.\r",
        "Ah!\n",
        "Take this, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM06FromKoga",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM06\n",
        "from Koga."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaExplainTM06",
      "en_US": [
        "Sealed within that TM06 lies\n",
        "Toxic!\r",
        "It is a secret technique dating\n",
        "back some four hundred years."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymHack_Text_KogaSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahahaha!\n",
        "The League bids me give you this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_MakeSpaceForThis",
      "en_US": "Make space for this, child!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymHack_Text_KogaAbilityCapsule",
      "en_US": [
        "And this is my own gift.\n",
        "A ninja’s secret!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymHack_Text_KogaAbilityCapsuleAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "An Ability Capsule switches a\n",
        "Pokémon to its other Ability.\r",
        "A foe who thinks he knows your\n",
        "Pokémon is a foe already beaten."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_repeatOffer_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Back again, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}?\n",
        "Perfect timing!\r",
        "I’ve got a stew on the stove.\n",
        "Mind watching the Gym for a bit?"
