        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve waited for\n",
        "this since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Show me how cold you’ve become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You’ve\n",
        "grown strong since Oak’s lab!\r",
        "Now let our Pokémon talk with\n",
        "their fists!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Ghost whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve watched your\n",
        "Dragons grow since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now prove you’re worthy of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Your Flying Pokémon\n",
        "have come far since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Let’s see if they can keep up with\n",
        "my Dragonite!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_SomeoneToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? Someone came into the Gym\n",
        "looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: So you want to be a Gym\n",
        "Leader yourself? Good for you.\r",
        "But a Leader’s job doesn’t end\n",
        "with one battle.\r",
        "Challengers come every day, and\n",
        "they all expect the Leader.\r",
        "How about you watch my Gym for an\n",
        "afternoon? Prove you can hold it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: A Gym of your own, huh?\n",
        "Fine. Here’s the deal.\r",
        "I need a break. You watch my Gym,\n",
        "and if a challenger shows up…\r",
        "you beat them. Easy, right?\n",
        "Unless you’re scared!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Hey, kid! Word is\n",
        "you’re after a Gym of your own!\r",
        "In the army, we’d call this a\n",
        "field test!\r",
        "You hold my Gym against the next\n",
        "challenger. Roger that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh my… A Gym in Pallet\n",
        "Town? How lovely.\r",
        "Would you mind watching my Gym\n",
        "while I tend to the flowers?\r",
        "If a challenger comes, please\n",
        "greet them for me."
      ]
    },
