      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahahaha! So the child\n",
        "would be a Leader?\r",
        "A ninja tests his student in\n",
        "secret. Hold my Gym while I…\r",
        "watch from the shadows. Two\n",
        "challengers approach. Ready?"
      ]
    },
