      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I knew you would ask.\n",
        "I saw this moment a week ago.\r",
        "Two challengers will come\n",
        "through my Gym today.\r",
        "You will face them. I already\n",
        "know how it ends… Do you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! A future Leader!\n",
        "Here’s a quiz for you!\r",
        "Question: who holds a Gym when\n",
        "its Leader is out?\r",
        "Answer: you do! Two challengers\n",
        "are on their way. Fire it up!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_offer_7",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: So. You want the\n",
        "League’s blessing as well.\r",
        "Then hold my Gym. Two\n",
        "challengers are waiting.\r",
        "Let us see if you can protect\n",
        "what is yours."
      ]
    },
