      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Don’t you have your own Gym\n",
        "now? Go run it!\r",
        "I’m not sharing my challengers!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ha! You’ve got your own\n",
        "base to defend now, Leader!\r",
        "Get back to Pallet!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh my, you have a Gym of\n",
