    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: A Leader guards their own\n",
        "Gym, not another’s.\r",
        "Return to Pallet Town!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I see a Gym in Pallet\n",
        "Town… and challengers waiting\f",
        "for you. Go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_6",
      "en_US": [
