        "Gym now?\r",
        "Answer: you! So go run it!\n",
        "Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_ownGym_7",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: You have a Gym of your\n",
        "own now. Guard it.\r",
        "Mine needs no help from you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back when you’re ready.\n",
        "My Gym isn’t going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I heard you made it\n",
        "through Mt. Moon. Knew you would!\r",
        "Here, I made this for you.\n",
        "Let one of your Pokémon hold it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: …And before you go. Oak\n",
        "made me promise to give you this.\r",
        "Don’t get the wrong idea! I don’t\n",
        "want my rival losing to a fluke!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! Heard you’re\n",
        "still in the fight, kid!\r",
        "Every soldier needs armor.\n",
        "Take this and keep your head down!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, there you are… I came\n",
        "all the way from Celadon.\r",
        "Mt. Moon must have been so dark.\n",
        "This will keep your Pokémon safe."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! Did you notice me\n",
        "following you through Mt. Moon?\r",
        "No? Good. A ninja’s armor.\n",
        "Take it… and tell no one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I saw you leave Mt. Moon.\n",
        "I saw you take this from me.\r",
        "So… take it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz time! What keeps\n",
        "a Pokémon safe from its weakness?\r",
        "Answer: this! Take it, kid!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo! You made it through\n",
        "Mt. Moon!\r",
        "A true fighter guards his body.\n",
        "Take this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Hmph. Oak pestered me\n",
        "until I brought you this.\r",
        "Take it before I change my mind,\n",
        "whippersnapper!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_8",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: Hello again, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\n",
        "I was in Cerulean… shopping.\r",
        "This is for you. No weakness will\n",
        "crack your Pokémon with this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_guardGift_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: You made it past Mt. Moon.\n",
        "Not bad.\r",
        "A Pokémon is only as strong as its\n",
        "weakest point. Cover yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I took the ferry\n",
        "all the way out here!\r",
        "You’ve learned to take a hit.\n",
        "Now learn to land one. Here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Ugh, it’s so hot here!\n",
        "…Fine. Here.\r",
        "I said I’d find you when you were\n",
        "ready. Don’t make me regret it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Kid! You’ve survived the\n",
        "front lines. Time for artillery!\r",
        "With this, nothing can stop your\n",
        "attacks cold!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: My, what a long boat ride…\n",
        "I dozed off twice.\r",
        "Please take this. May nothing\n",
        "stand in your Pokémon’s way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! Surprised? A ninja\n",
        "goes where his student goes.\r",
        "You are ready for my secret\n",
        "technique. Take it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: Seven Badges. I saw this\n",
        "day, too.\r",
        "Take it. No wall will hold your\n",
        "Pokémon back now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! One more quiz! What\n",
        "lets an attack hit when it\f",
        "shouldn’t?\r",
        "Answer: this! I’ve been saving it\n",
        "for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! Seven Badges!\n",
        "You’ve built a fine guard.\r",
        "Now, a fine strike! Take this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Seven Badges, eh? I suppose\n",
        "I can’t call you whippersnapper.\r",
        "…Well, I can. But take this\n",
        "anyway."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_8",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: Cinnabar is far too warm\n",
        "for me. I won’t stay long.\r",
        "This is for you. No foe will shrug\n",
        "off your attacks with it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_edgeGift_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Seven Badges. You’ve proven\n",
        "yourself.\r",
        "Take this. No Pokémon will ignore\n",
        "your attacks again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on. A Gym Leader battles with\n",
        "one type, and no two alike.\r",
        "Fix your team first, then\n",
        "come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_hold_shift",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} left you in charge of\n",
        "the Gym."
      ]
    },
