      "en_US": "Giovanni"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Great! I’ll stand over here\n",
        "and watch. Pretend I’m not here!\r",
        "Take my spot, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: I’ll be right over there,\n",
        "watching Everything.\r",
        "Don’t you dare mess up my Gym!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: I’ll observe from the\n",
        "flank, soldier!\r",
        "You take the command post!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: I’ll sit with my flowers over\n",
        "there… and watch quietly.\r",
        "Please, take my place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: I shall vanish into the\n",
        "shadows… and watch.\r",
        "Take my place, child."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I will watch from over\n",
        "there.\r",
        "Though I already know how it ends."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: I’ll watch from the sidelines!\r",
        "Pop quiz: who’s Leader today?\n",
        "Answer: you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_observe_7",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: I will be watching.\r",
        "Take my place… for now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_intro_0",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} isn’t battling today?\r",
        "You’re filling in? Then you’re the\n",
        "one I have to beat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_intro_1",
      "en_US": [
        "I came all this way to battle\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}…\r",
        "Fine! A stand-in will do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_intro_2",
      "en_US": [
        "A substitute Leader?\n",
        "This Badge is as good as mine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_intro_3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} sent you? Is this\n",
        "some kind of test?\r",
        "Whatever. Let’s battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_after_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Tell {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} I’ll be back…\n",
        "for both of you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_after_1",
      "en_US": [
        "You’d make a great Leader.\n",
        "No, really!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_guest_after_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Man… I’ll train harder and\n",
        "come back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_0",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Solid work! You held my\n",
        "Gym like a real Leader.\r",
        "The League will hear that you have\n",
        "my approval. Rock on, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Two Rock Gyms in Kanto!\n",
        "I couldn’t be prouder, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "The League will hear that you have\n",
        "my approval. Rock on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Basics win battles. You\n",
        "proved it today!\r",
        "The League will hear that you have\n",
        "my approval!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. Not bad.\n",
        "Not bad at all.\r",
        "OK, OK! You’ve got my approval.\n",
        "Don’t let it go to your head!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: …Fine. Fine!\n",
        "You’re really good with them.\r",
        "Maybe Kanto can handle two Water\n",
        "Gyms. Maybe.\r",
        "You’ve got my approval. Now get\n",
        "out before I change my mind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Outstanding, soldier!\r",
        "You’ve got my approval, kid!\n",
        "I’ll radio it to the League!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ha! I’ll admit it, kid.\n",
        "You’ve got a real spark.\r",
        "You’ve got my approval! And if\n",
        "you need parts, call me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Your Gym’s built like\n",
        "a fortress! I take it back!\r",
        "You’ve got my approval, soldier!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: How wonderful. You welcomed\n",
        "them as a Leader should.\r",
        "You have my approval, of course.\n",
        "I shall tell the League today."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Your Pokémon were in full\n",
        "bloom today.\r",
        "You have my approval, and my\n",
        "friendship. Please, take care."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …Hmm! You did not falter.\r",
        "Very well. Koga, master of\n",
        "Poison, grants his approval!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …Fwahaha. I was wrong to\n",
        "doubt you.\r",
        "A true Poison master. You have\n",
        "my approval… and my respect."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! Your Bug Pokémon\n",
        "strike like ninja.\r",
        "You have my approval!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …Just as I foresaw.\r",
        "You have my approval. The\n",
        "League knows it already."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I saw a Psychic Gym in\n",
        "Pallet Town. I resented it.\r",
        "Now I see why it was there.\n",
        "You have my approval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: Your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you completely.\r",
        "You have my approval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Correct answer! You’ve\n",
        "got fire in you, kid!\r",
        "My approval is yours!\n",
        "Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_mentor_approve_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: That’s the spirit! Two\n",
        "Fire Gyms in Kanto!\r",
        "My approval is yours, kid!\n",
        "Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_cv_leader_approve_7",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: …You protect what is\n",
        "yours. I respect that.\r",
        "The League will have my approval.\n",
        "Now leave me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0514_T08GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_ApprovalCount",
      "en_US": [
